RULES
- Return every unit, with the same number n, and the same type: a paragraph stays a paragraph, a list stays a list with the same number of items unless the note explicitly asks otherwise.
- Copy a unit or list item verbatim when nothing has to change in it. Edit only the units where an item genuinely fits, and change only the words needed.
- Keep the total length close to {{ words }} words unless the note asks otherwise.
- Never invent achievements, employers, numbers or technologies that the resume or the note does not support. If an item does not fit truthfully anywhere, leave it out.
- Every item under "MUST STAY" must still be present.
- Do not repeat information that the rest of the resume already covers just to fit an item in.
- Plain text only: no markdown, no HTML other than the tags shown below.

OUTPUT FORMAT
Only the units, nothing else:

<el n="0">paragraph text</el>
<el n="1" list="true"><li>bullet</li><li>bullet</li></el>